{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99299","id":2182498229,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6CFke1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99299","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99299.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99299.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99299","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99299/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99299/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99299/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7e3d480087d6dadcb2624afa7b21b3127103d615","number":99299,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move `_scene_particles_set_view_axis` to new static function to allow call to be done on render thread, preventing multi threaded error on compute shader execution.","user":{"login":"Bonkahe","id":11287274,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjg3Mjc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11287274?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe","html_url":"https://github.com/Bonkahe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bonkahe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\nResolves #99025 by calling the function `particles_set_view_axis` on the render thread.\r\nThe error would occur when the number of instances in the tree went over 1k, resulting in the `thread_cull_threshold` being exceeded, this resulted in the multi-threaded culling method being called for particle effects, this then subsequently called `particles_set_view_axis` which was now being called from a thread other than the render thread, and would immediately throw errors for trying to execute a compute shader on any thread other than the render thread (this only occurred either the `draw_order` or `transform_align` settings were changed on a GPUParticles3D).\r\n\r\nI initially was going to just call it directly using a `callable_mp` style call, but it would not allow it because it's calling it on a singleton, so what I did was create a static function within `RendererSceneCull` to call the function same as before, then called that static function using `call_on_render_thread` and passing it a `callable_mp_static` constructor.\r\nIf there is a way to do it in a single line that would be preferable, but I had no small amount of issues trying to get that work, and couldn't find any examples elsewhere of that functionality to reference.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":105